LJMS is MIT licensed, with one exception: the legacy/ directory.

  everything outside legacy/   MIT, below
  legacy/                      GNU GPL v2, see legacy/LICENSE

legacy/ holds the 2001 in-memory LJMS, an unrelated earlier program kept as a
historical example. It shares no code with the queue in src/, and the two are
here only as an archive beside a rewrite.

